kubectl patch svc jaeger-query -n tracing -p '{"spec":{"type":"LoadBalancer"}}'



======================================

✅ Solution: Delete & Recreate the Service
1️⃣ Export the existing YAML
kubectl get svc jaeger-query -n tracing -o yaml > jaeger-query.yaml

2️⃣ Edit the file

Open it:

vi jaeger-query.yaml

👉 Remove these lines completely:

clusterIP: None
clusterIPs:
  - None


👉 Then change:

type: ClusterIP


to:

type: LoadBalancer

3️⃣ Delete the old service
kubectl delete svc jaeger-query -n tracing

4️⃣ Apply the corrected YAML
kubectl apply -f jaeger-query.yaml

🎉 Now it will create a proper LoadBalancer service.
